# _td_help - help text generation library
# This file body becomes the function body via autoload

_td_show_help() {
  cat <<'HELP'
todo - Task manager for the terminal

Usage: todo <command> [options]

Viewing:
  board                      Show kanban board view (default)
  ui [--checkbox]            Interactive board view
  ls [-s status] [-p prio]   List tasks (with optional filters)
  show <id>                  Show every field of one task
  summary [--oneline]        Task counts by status (--oneline for your prompt)

Tasks:
  add [-p prio] [-t tags] [-r url] <title>
                             Add a task (-t accepts a,b or repeated -t)
  edit <id> <title>          Edit task title
  rm <id>                    Remove a task
  done <id>                  Mark task as completed
  move <id> <status>         Move task to a status
  priority <id> <value>      Set priority (high, medium, low)
  ref <id> [url]             Attach a URL to a task, or show the current one
  tag add|rm <id> <tag>      Add or remove a tag

Bulk & archive:
  bulk done|move|rm <ids>    Operate on several tasks at once
  archive                    Archive all completed tasks
  archive ls                 List archived tasks
  archive undo <id>          Restore a task from the archive

Lists & statuses:
  list                       List all lists
  list create|switch <name>  Create a list, or switch the active one
  status                     List statuses for the current list
  status add|rm <name>       Add or remove a custom status

Other:
  help                       Show this help message
  version                    Show version
HELP
}
